    path: ".claude/skills/add-skill/SKILL.md"
    standalone: Installs and manages external skills through the skill registry; no fixed agent dispatch or rule gate.
  -
    path: ".claude/skills/bundle-sync/SKILL.md"
    standalone: "Compares an unpacked project with a newer bundle copy and applies approved updates; operates on files, not on agents or rules."
  -
    path: ".claude/skills/changelog/SKILL.md"
    standalone: Writes VERSION and CHANGELOG.md entries via the changelog script; no agents or gating rules.
  -
    path: ".claude/skills/checkpoint/SKILL.md"
    standalone: Saves mid-session progress to the active pitch's checkpoint.md; no agents or gating rules.
  -
    path: ".claude/skills/dependency-security/SKILL.md"
    standalone: Read-only dependency vulnerability audit run on demand; dispatches no agent and names no rule.
  -
    path: ".claude/skills/eval-harness/SKILL.md"
    standalone: Evaluation framework skill (eval-driven development) invoked on demand; no fixed dispatch or rule edge.
  -
    path: ".claude/skills/pitch-compress/SKILL.md"
    standalone: Compacts a shipped pitch into knowledge and a done-work record via scripts; dispatches no agent.
  -
    path: ".claude/skills/resume/SKILL.md"
    standalone: Reads the status index and loads one pitch's context; no agents or gating rules.
  -
    path: ".claude/skills/search/SKILL.md"
    standalone: "Queries the knowledge graph, sessions, ADRs and requirements; dispatches no agent."
  -
    path: ".claude/skills/setup-validator/SKILL.md"
    standalone: "Verifies setup output (context, entry files, graph, mirrors) with the validator script; no agents or rules."
  -
    path: ".claude/skills/state/SKILL.md"
    standalone: Reports an evidence-backed project snapshot from scripts and records; dispatches no agent.
  -
    path: ".claude/skills/switch/SKILL.md"
    standalone: Checkpoints the current pitch then loads the target through the resume flow; dispatches no agent.
  -
    path: ".claude/skills/sync/SKILL.md"
    standalone: Syncs local workflow tasks with a Notion database; no agents or gating rules.
  -
    path: ".claude/skills/workflow-doctor/SKILL.md"
    standalone: Diagnoses the install and restores missing template artifacts; no agents or gating rules.
